# Paths the dev watcher must not treat as source changes.
#
# The pattern panel writes `patterns.swync` into whatever folder the app
# currently has open. Under `tauri dev` the app's working directory is this
# crate, so that file lands here — and every edit to a drawn pattern then looks
# to the watcher like a source change, rebuilding and restarting the app
# mid-edit. Ignoring it keeps the composer usable in development.
#
# This is a workaround for the app defaulting its project root to the working
# directory; see `project_root` in src/lib.rs.
patterns.swync
